On 2007-10-09, Tony Crawford wrote:
> Wondering about the sense of the autopickup option.

I have it on. It _is_ convenient, provided that you also set pickup_burden
and autopickup_exceptions to sensible values. Picking up objects by
autopickup does not take a turn, and with pickup_burden=u and a nice set of
exceptions, you can really finetune it so it only applies to stuff you want
picked up anyway. Also, consider combining autopickup_exception patterns
and #naming of objects.

